$('models').onclick=()=>modal(`${isScaling(d)?'<h2>SCALING MODEL 1.0.0 · SOLVER 0.4.1</h2><p>Generic educational 100G/50GBd and200G/100GBd PAM4; nominal25°C/1310nm. Four differential electrical symbols map through a sine MZM response to four optical powers. Adjacent gap/span, nonlinearity and a conservative three-pole tail proxy are planning screens, not BER/eye/TDECQ.</p><p>RF α(f)=0.35√(f/25)+0.05(f/25) dB/mm; driver/modulator/route first-order poles, three frequency samples. Route≤5mm; effective swing≥0.65Vppd; tail proxy≤0.65; gap/span≥0.22; average≥−4dBm; ER≥3dB. All coefficients are Assumed.</p><p>Each1×N stage:10log10(N)+excess dB; trace every actual optical graph edge. Electrical boundary:connected EIC channels plus all shared overhead; excludes laser, RX, DSP/FEC and cooling. pJ/bit uses functional gross rate. High-speed thermal is Unsupported.</p><p>Structural primary sources: Caltech100G PAM4 transmitter and Nature Electronics112GBd SiPh-CMOS transmitter. Their measured coefficients and reported energy are not the game assumptions; full URLs and boundaries are in docs/MODELS_V041.md.</p><hr><h3>Legacy Level1–5 models</h3>':''}<h2>MODELS · revision 0.2.1 · O-band</h2><p>Calculated는 Assumed Parameter로 계산했다는 뜻이며 Validated가 아닙니다. 본 게임은 Educational Grade입니다. Measured 값은 사용하지 않습니다.</p><p>MZM: Vπ=3.75 V·mm / Length; IL=1.5+Length dB; T±=10^(−IL/10)[1+cos(π Bias ±π Swing/(2Vπ))]/2.<br>MRM Cavity BW=31.44 GHz from 0.18 nm FWHM at 1310 nm. Through-port: T(Δ)=10^(−1/10)[1−0.95/(1+(Δ/0.09 nm)²)]. Δ에는 Cold Resonance, 0.08 nm/K, Bias shift 0.08 nm/V, Heater 0.01 nm/mW가 포함됩니다. Heater 0–80 mW, Auto Lock target +0.04 nm.<br>EAM: T(V)=10^(−[1+1.8|V|^1.5(1+0.02(λ−1310))]/10), V=Bias±Swing/2. 이는 Beer–Lambert 구조를 사용하는 가정된 Absorption Fit이며 O-band GeSi QCSE Device의 검증 모델이 아닙니다.</p><p>RF: 동일 Polyline Centerline 길이 × Packet α, Delivered Swing = Vout×10^(−Loss/20). Driver/Route/Modulator 1-pole response의 Nyquist amplitude를 별도로 두 Optical Level 계산에 적용합니다. BW ratio는 BER/Eye Margin이 아닙니다.</p><p>Average=(High+Low)/2, ER=10log10(High/Low), OMA=High−Low [mW]. NRZ equiprobable 0/1 assumption. Power 경계=Driver+Heater+EAM Bias, External Laser 제외. pJ/bit는 동일 Nominal 환경의 유효 Gross Rate를 분모로 사용합니다. Stable HUD의 Gross는 시험한 Corner 중 최솟값입니다. Net Throughput은 FEC/Protocol 미모델링으로 Unsupported입니다.</p><p>Thermal: Ambient+각 Driver의 6 K/W 거리 Kernel+이웃 Heater의 40 K/W Kernel. Self Heater는 Resonance 효율로 처리합니다. FEM이 아닌 Educational Approximation입니다.</p><p>Primary Sources: <a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/nphoton.2017.120" target="_blank">MZM VπL trade-off</a> · <a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-024-45301-3" target="_blank">MRM voltage / heater response</a> · <a href="https://imec-publications.be/entities/publication/def47af9-9bb6-4d64-adef-533d86b5112d" target="_blank">O-band GeSi QCSE EAM</a>. 수치·Geometry는 논문 제품 사양이 아닌 교육용 가정입니다.</p><p>Routing v0.3.0: Optical은 Sharp Orthogonal Centerline, RF는 Polyline입니다. Optical Loss=0.12 dB/mm×Length+0.04 dB×Bend (기존 Assumed 계수). 반경·Cross-section·RF Bend Reflection·물리 Crossing Loss는 Unsupported입니다. Keep-out / Component 내부 / Boundary는 Planning Rule Check이며 DRC가 아닙니다.<br>적용 범위: 25 GBd NRZ, MZM 0.8–2.5 mm, RF ≤10 mm, Ambient 20–60 °C, Laser 1309–1311 nm. Unsupported: BER/Eye, Full-wave, DRC, Thermal FEM, GDS. Score는 유효 설계에서 max(0,100−20×Power W−2×Footprint mm²)이며 비교표가 우선입니다.</p>`);
function download(name,text,type='application/json'){const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([text],{type})),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=name;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)}
$('files').onclick=async()=>{let names=[];if(ready)names=await storage.read('names')||[];modal(`<h2>DESIGN SAVE / LOAD / EXPORT</h2><label>Design name <input id="rename" value="${esc(d.name)}"></label><div class="row"><button id="namedSave">별도 저장</button><select id="savedDesign">${names.map(n=>`<option>${esc(n)}</option>`).join('')}</select><button id="namedLoad">불러오기</button><button id="recover">Backup 복구</button></div><div class="row"><button id="json">JSON Export</button><button id="png">Floorplan PNG</button><button id="summary">Summary</button></div><p>JSON을 붙여넣으면 업로드 없이 복원할 수 있습니다. Import 실패 시 현재 Design은 유지됩니다.</p><textarea id="jsonText" placeholder="Paste Design JSON"></textarea><button id="import">검증 후 Import</button>`);$('rename').onchange=e=>{checkpoint();d.name=e.target.value.slice(0,100)||'Untitled';changed()};$('json').onclick=()=>download('photonics-design.json',JSON.stringify({schema:d.schema,routeModelVersion:'0.3.0',solverVersion:solve(d).version,modelVersion:'0.2.1',models:Object.values(LIB).map(l=>({id:l.id,version:l.version,grade:l.grade,evidence:l.evidence})),design:exportDesign(d),referenceBackup:studio?.exportBackup()},null,2));$('summary').onclick=()=>download('engineering-summary.json',JSON.stringify({design:d.name,assumption:'Generic Educational Model',solver:solve(d),modelVersion:'0.2.1',unsupported:['BER','DRC','GDS']},null,2));$('import').onclick=async()=>{try{const raw=JSON.parse($('jsonText').value),next=validateImport(raw),importBackup=studio?.prepareBackup(raw.referenceBackup);if(ready)await storage.archiveOriginal(raw.design??raw);if(ready&&(raw.design??raw).modelVersion==='0.2.0')await storage.archiveLegacy(raw.design??raw);if(raw.referenceBackup&&studio)await studio.importBackup(importBackup);checkpoint();d=next;selected=null;pending=null;changed();$('modal').close();toast(next.nets.find(n=>n.route?.recoveryNotice)?.route.recoveryNotice||d.migrationNotice||'Design 검증 및 복원 완료')}catch(e){toast('Import 거부: '+e.message)}};$('namedSave').onclick=async()=>{if(!ready)return toast('저장 불가. JSON Export를 사용하세요.');try{await persist();await storage.write('named:'+d.name,clone(d));await storage.write('names',[...new Set([...names,d.name])]);toast('별도 저장 완료')}catch(e){toast('저장 실패: '+e.message)}};$('namedLoad').onclick=async()=>{try{const next=validateImport(await storage.read('named:'+$('savedDesign').value));checkpoint();d=next;selected=null;changed();$('modal').close()}catch(e){toast('불러오기 실패: '+e.message)}};$('recover').onclick=async()=>{try{const next=validateImport(await storage.read('backup'));checkpoint();d=next;selected=null;changed();$('modal').close()}catch(e){toast('Backup 복구 실패: '+e.message)}};$('png').onclick=exportPNG;};
function exportPNG(){const svg=$('board').cloneNode(true);svg.setAttribute('xmlns',NS);svg.setAttribute('viewBox',[-20,-20,planningBounds(d).w+40,planningBounds(d).h+40].join(' '));svg.setAttribute('width',1600);svg.setAttribute('height',1062);svg.querySelectorAll('.flow,.waypoint,.route-hit').forEach(e=>e.remove());const exportStyle=document.createElementNS(NS,'style');exportStyle.textContent='text{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}.net{fill:none;stroke-width:3}.route-invalid{stroke:#ff7c88;stroke-dasharray:7 4}.port{stroke:#0d1625;stroke-width:3}.invalid .body{stroke:#ff647e;stroke-width:2}.route-label{fill:#f0f6ff;font-size:12px;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#091321;stroke-width:4}';svg.insertBefore(exportStyle,svg.firstChild);const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([new XMLSerializer().serializeToString(svg)],{type:'image/svg+xml'})),image=new Image;image.onload=()=>{const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');canvas.width=1600;canvas.height=1062;const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d');ctx.fillStyle='#091321';ctx.fillRect(0,0,1600,1062);ctx.drawImage(image,0,0);canvas.toBlob(blob=>{const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(blob);a.download='pic-floorplan.png';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href),1000)});URL.revokeObjectURL(url)};image.onerror=()=>toast('PNG Export 실패');image.src=url;}
$('brief').onchange=e=>{checkpoint();if(isScaling({brief:e.target.value})&&!isScaling(d))d=startScaling(d,e.target.value);else if(!isScaling({brief:e.target.value})&&isScaling(d)){const old=d.snapshots.find(s=>!isScaling(s.design));d=old?validateImport(old.design):empty();enterLevel(d,e.target.value);}else enterLevel(d,e.target.value);if(d.brief==='optical')pushSnapshot(capture(d,'Optical Start · '+d.name));pending=null;placing=null;addingWaypoint=null;changed()};
for(const [id,key,min,max]of [['ambient','temperature',20,60],['wavelength','wavelength',1309,1311]])$(id).onchange=e=>{const value=Number(e.target.value);if(e.target.value===''||!Number.isFinite(value)||value<min||value>max){toast(key+' 적용 범위 '+min+'…'+max+' 밖');render();return;}checkpoint();d.environment[key]=value;changed()};
$('snapshot').onclick=()=>{if(dirty)return toast('Snapshot 전에 Test를 실행하세요.');checkpoint();if(d.snapshots.length>=6)d.snapshots.shift();d.snapshots.push(capture(d,d.name+' · '+d.snapshots.length));scheduleSave();toast('Snapshot 보존 완료. 다른 Technology로 바꾸고 Compare하세요.')};
$('compare').onclick=()=>{if(isScaling(d))return scalingUI.compare();if(!d.snapshots.length&&!d.challenge?.baseline)return toast('Test 후 Snapshot을 먼저 저장하세요.');const options=(d.brief==='rf'&&d.challenge?.baseline?'<option value="baseline">RF Baseline</option>':'')+`<option value="current">Current · ${esc(d.name)}</option>`+d.snapshots.map((s,i)=>`<option value="${i}">${esc(s.name)}</option>`).join('');modal(`<h2>DESIGN COMPARISON</h2><div class="snapshot-row"><select id="compareA">${options}</select><span>vs</span><select id="compareB">${options}</select><button id="loadSnapshot">A Design 불러오기</button></div><div id="comparisonTable"></div>`);$('compareA').value=d.brief==='rf'&&d.challenge?.baseline?'baseline':String(Math.max(0,d.snapshots.length-1));$('compareB').value='current';function chosen(id){return $(id).value==='baseline'?d.challenge.baseline:$(id).value==='current'?capture(d,'Current'):d.snapshots[+$(id).value];}function update(){const a=chosen('compareA'),b=chosen('compareB');if(dirty&&[$('compareA').value,$('compareB').value].includes('current')){$('comparisonTable').innerHTML='<p>Current Result가 STALE입니다. 닫고 Test를 실행한 뒤 비교하세요.</p>';return;}const comparison=compareSnapshots(a,b),ra=comparison.a,rb=comparison.b;const laneList=(r,key,suffix)=>r.lanes.map((l,i)=>'L'+(i+1)+': '+fmt(l[key])+' '+suffix).join('<br>'),rfList=r=>r.lanes.map((l,i)=>'L'+(i+1)+': '+fmt(l.rf?.length)+' mm / '+fmt(l.rf?.swing)+' '+(l.rf?.convention||'')+' V / BW '+fmt(l.rf?.bwRatio)).join('<br>');const rows=[['Requirement Satisfaction',ra.status,rb.status],['Valid Lanes / Gross',ra.gross/25+' / '+ra.gross+' Gb/s',rb.gross/25+' / '+rb.gross+' Gb/s'],['Optical Average',laneList(ra,'power','dBm'),laneList(rb,'power','dBm')],['High / Low',ra.lanes.map(l=>fmt(l.highDbm)+' / '+fmt(l.lowDbm)+' dBm').join('<br>'),rb.lanes.map(l=>fmt(l.highDbm)+' / '+fmt(l.lowDbm)+' dBm').join('<br>')],['Extinction',laneList(ra,'er','dB'),laneList(rb,'er','dB')],['OMA (linear power)',laneList(ra,'omaMw','mW'),laneList(rb,'omaMw','mW')],['RF Length / Delivered / BW ratio',rfList(ra),rfList(rb)],['RF Total / Worst Route',fmt(ra.routing.rfTotal)+' / '+fmt(ra.routing.rfWorst)+' mm',fmt(rb.routing.rfTotal)+' / '+fmt(rb.routing.rfWorst)+' mm'],['RF Attenuation / Lane',ra.lanes.map(l=>fmt(l.rf?.loss)+' dB').join('<br>'),rb.lanes.map(l=>fmt(l.rf?.loss)+' dB').join('<br>')],['Optical Total / Worst Lane Length',fmt(ra.routing.opticalTotal)+' / '+fmt(Math.max(0,...ra.lanes.map(l=>l.optical?.length||0)))+' mm',fmt(rb.routing.opticalTotal)+' / '+fmt(Math.max(0,...rb.lanes.map(l=>l.optical?.length||0)))+' mm'],['Optical Propagation / Bend Loss per Lane',ra.lanes.map(l=>fmt(l.optical?.propagationLoss)+' / '+fmt(l.optical?.bendLoss)+' dB').join('<br>'),rb.lanes.map(l=>fmt(l.optical?.propagationLoss)+' / '+fmt(l.optical?.bendLoss)+' dB').join('<br>')],['Layout / Routing Errors',ra.routing.errorCount,rb.routing.errorCount],['Driver / Heater / Bias Power',Object.values(ra.powerBreakdown).slice(0,3).map(v=>fmt(v*1000)+' mW').join(' / '),Object.values(rb.powerBreakdown).slice(0,3).map(v=>fmt(v*1000)+' mW').join(' / ')],['Nominal Electrical Power / pJ per Nominal Gross bit',fmt(ra.powerW)+' W / '+fmt(ra.pjPerGrossBit),fmt(rb.powerW)+' W / '+fmt(rb.pjPerGrossBit)],['Footprint sum',fmt(ra.area)+' mm²',fmt(rb.area)+' mm²'],['Thermal / Detuning',ra.lanes.map(l=>fmt(l.temperature)+' °C / '+fmt(l.detuning,3)+' nm').join('<br>'),rb.lanes.map(l=>fmt(l.temperature)+' °C / '+fmt(l.detuning,3)+' nm').join('<br>')],['Variation Sensitivity',ra.variation.length?ra.variation.map(v=>fmt(v.environment.temperature)+' °C / '+fmt(v.environment.wavelength,3)+' nm · '+v.status+' · ERmin '+fmt(v.minEr)+' · '+fmt(v.powerW)+' W').join('<br>'):'Corner 미시험',rb.variation.length?rb.variation.map(v=>fmt(v.environment.temperature)+' °C / '+fmt(v.environment.wavelength,3)+' nm · '+v.status+' · ERmin '+fmt(v.minEr)+' · '+fmt(v.powerW)+' W').join('<br>'):'Corner 미시험'],['Environment / Solver',fmt(ra.environment.temperature)+' °C / '+fmt(ra.environment.wavelength,3)+' nm · '+a.solverVersion,fmt(rb.environment.temperature)+' °C / '+fmt(rb.environment.wavelength,3)+' nm · '+b.solverVersion],['Model Grade',ra.grade+' / '+ra.evidence,rb.grade+' / '+rb.evidence]];let reason=comparison.comparable?'동일 Brief·환경·Solver: 직접 비교 가능':'직접 비교 불가: '+(!comparison.sameEnvironment?'Brief 또는 환경이 다릅니다. ':'')+(!comparison.sameSolver?'Solver Version이 다릅니다. ':'');$('comparisonTable').innerHTML='<p>'+reason+' · 저장 Result를 신뢰하지 않고 Design을 현재 Solver로 재계산했습니다.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>'+esc(a.name)+'</th><th>'+esc(b.name)+'</th><th>Δ B−A</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+rows.map(row=>{let delta='—';const pairs={'RF Total / Worst Route':[rb.routing.rfTotal-ra.routing.rfTotal,rb.routing.rfWorst-ra.routing.rfWorst,' mm'],'Optical Total / Worst Lane Length':[rb.routing.opticalTotal-ra.routing.opticalTotal,Math.max(0,...rb.lanes.map(l=>l.optical?.length||0))-Math.max(0,...ra.lanes.map(l=>l.optical?.length||0)),' mm'],'Footprint sum':[rb.area-ra.area,null,' mm²'],'Layout / Routing Errors':[rb.routing.errorCount-ra.routing.errorCount,null,''],'Nominal Electrical Power / pJ per Nominal Gross bit':[rb.powerW-ra.powerW,null,' W']};if(comparison.comparable&&pairs[row[0]]){const [v,w,unit]=pairs[row[0]];delta='<span class="'+(v<0?'delta-lower':v>0?'delta-higher':'')+'">'+(v>0?'+':'')+fmt(v)+(w!==null?' / '+(w>0?'+':'')+fmt(w):'')+unit+'</span>';}return '<tr>'+row.map(cell=>'<td>'+cell+'</td>').join('')+'<td>'+delta+'</td></tr>'}).join('')+'</tbody></table><p>'+ (comparison.comparable?'B−A: Footprint '+fmt(rb.area-ra.area)+' mm² · RF Total '+fmt(rb.routing.rfTotal-ra.routing.rfTotal)+' mm · Optical Total '+fmt(rb.routing.opticalTotal-ra.routing.opticalTotal)+' mm · Planning errors '+(rb.routing.errorCount-ra.routing.errorCount)+' · Power '+fmt((rb.powerW-ra.powerW)*1000)+' mW. Driver를 가까이 옮겼다면 Thermal / Detuning 변화도 확인하세요. 개선과 악화를 함께 비교합니다. Δ는 변화량이며 짧은 Route를 전체 Design의 승리로 평가하지 않습니다.':'동일 조건으로 Test한 Snapshot을 새로 저장하세요.')+'</p><p>Original Result A: '+esc(a.originalResult?.version||'미기록')+' / '+esc(a.originalResult?.status||'—')+' · B: '+esc(b.originalResult?.version||'미기록')+' / '+esc(b.originalResult?.status||'—')+' — 원본은 보존하며 표는 현재 Solver로 재계산합니다.</p>';}for(const id of ['compareA','compareB'])$(id).onchange=update;$('loadSnapshot').onclick=()=>{const a=chosen('compareA');checkpoint();const snapshots=clone(d.snapshots);d=validateImport(a.design);d.snapshots=snapshots;selected=null;pending=null;changed();$('modal').close();toast('Snapshot Design 복원. Test를 다시 실행하세요.')};update();};
window.addEventListener('resize',()=>render());
studio=installStudio({
 get:()=>({design:d,selected,pending,placing,addingWaypoint,view,dirty}),
 set:s=>{if('design'in s)d=s.design;if('selected'in s)selected=s.selected;if('pending'in s)pending=s.pending;if('placing'in s)placing=s.placing;if('addingWaypoint'in s)addingWaypoint=s.addingWaypoint;if('view'in s)view=s.view;if('dirty'in s)dirty=s.dirty;if('drag'in s)drag=s.drag;},
 checkpoint,changed,render,toast,pos,modal,persist,storage,ready:()=>ready,run:()=>$('run').click(),goal:brief=>isScaling({brief})?'Lane Array로 '+(brief==='scale400'?400:1600)+' Gb/s Gross를 만들고 같은 조건의 Architecture를 비교하세요.':LEVELS[brief].goal,
 captureInteraction:()=>({design:clone(d),historyLen:history.length,future:clone(future),dirty}),
 rollbackInteraction:s=>{d=clone(s.design);history.length=s.historyLen;future=clone(s.future);dirty=s.dirty;drag=null;}
});
scalingUI=installScalingUI({get:()=>({design:d,selected,pending,placing,view,dirty}),set:s=>{if('design'in s)d=s.design;if('selected'in s)selected=s.selected;if('pending'in s)pending=s.pending;if('placing'in s)placing=s.placing;if('view'in s)view=s.view;},checkpoint,changed,render,toast,modal});
